WEBVTT

00:09:28.636 --> 00:09:30.116
my class, my sexuality.

00:09:31.076 --> 00:09:33.356
She's got her own shame to deal with.

00:09:33.396 --> 00:09:35.716
But what we do need --
well, I need --

00:09:35.716 --> 00:09:37.436
is the ability to live safely.

00:09:38.116 --> 00:09:40.556
The ability to walk down
the street in drag

00:09:40.596 --> 00:09:43.436
and not have some homophobic passerby
do what he did to me.

00:09:44.036 --> 00:09:46.756
And the way we do that
is by doing some shame-work.

00:09:47.236 --> 00:09:48.436
It's about looking inside

00:09:48.476 --> 00:09:52.396
and realizing that all the boxes
that had been put there by the world

00:09:52.396 --> 00:09:53.636
are a lie.

00:09:53.676 --> 00:09:57.356
All the things that you've had
to shave off to make yourself smooth,

00:09:57.396 --> 00:09:58.636
bring them back.

00:09:58.676 --> 00:10:01.716
There's power there, there's value there.
There's beauty there.